+\begin{lemma}[separation amplifier]\label{lem:amplifier}
+Let $u,v\in\U(M_r(\C))$ with $\opnorm{u-v}=\varepsilon>0$.  Then
+there is an integer $1\le n\le\lceil\pi/(3\varepsilon)\rceil$ with
+\[
+  \opnorm{\,u^{\otimes n}-v^{\otimes n}\,}\;\ge\;1 .
